<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>VIGayapan | Advertising That Gets Attention</title>
  <meta name="description" content="VIGayapan connects businesses with advertising solutions and helps aspiring advertising professionals build their careers.">

  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #6c45f5;
      --dark: #17152b;
      --light: #f7f7fc;
      --text: #55556b;
      --white: #ffffff;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: var(--light);
      color: var(--dark);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 18px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 15px #0000000a;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 27px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--primary);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    nav a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--dark);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 22px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: var(--white);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      border: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .button-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--primary);
      border: 2px solid var(--primary);
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 100px 7% 90px;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0edff, #ffffff, #e8f5ff);
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e5deff;
      color: var(--primary);
      padding: 7px 15px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 70px);
      line-height: 1.12;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 22px auto 30px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 13px;
    }

    section {
      padding: 75px 7%;
    }

    .section-heading {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto 42px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 32px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #eae8f5;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px #19103d08;
    }

    .icon {
      font-size: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .card ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .card li {
      margin: 8px 0;
    }

    .highlight {
      background: var(--dark);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .highlight p,
    .highlight li {
      color: #d2d0e4;
    }

    .highlight .button {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .step {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 25px;
      border: 1px solid #eae8f5;
    }

    .step-number {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #e9e3ff;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .step p {
      color: var(--text);
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .notice {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 25px auto 0;
      padding: 18px;
      background: #fff8e7;
      color: #735318;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .cta {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6c45f5, #4226b5);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 65px 7%;
    }

    .cta h2 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .cta p {
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      color: #eee9ff;
    }

    .cta .button {
      background: white;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    footer {
      padding: 30px 7%;
      background: #121120;
      color: #d0cfe0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    footer a {
      color: #c7baff;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      header {
        padding: 16px 5%;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 14px;
      }

      nav {
        width: 100%;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 15px;
      }

      nav a {
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 70px 5%;
      }

      section {
        padding: 55px 5%;
      }

      .grid,
      .steps {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 25px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <a href="#" class="logo">VIGayapan.</a>

    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#advertisers">Join Us</a>
      <a href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <span class="badge">YOUR BRAND. OUR CREATIVE POWER.</span>

      <h1>
        Advertising that makes<br>
        <span>your brand stand out.</span>
      </h1>

      <p>
        VIGayapan connects businesses with advertising solutions and
        aspiring advertising professionals with opportunities to develop
        their skills and work with clients.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#services" class="button">Advertise Your Business</a>
        <a href="#advertisers" class="button button-outline">Become an Advertiser</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Two goals. One platform.</h2>
        <p>
          Whether you want to promote your business or build your advertising
          career, VIGayapan gives you a place to start.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">📢</div>
          <h3>For Businesses</h3>
          <p>
            Reach more people with advertising ideas designed around your
            business, audience and goals.
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>Social media advertising</li>
            <li>Creative promotional campaigns</li>
            <li>Local and offline advertising</li>
            <li>Brand awareness campaigns</li>
            <li>Campaign planning and coordination</li>
          </ul>

          <a href="#contact" class="button">Request Advertising</a>
        </article>

        <article class="card highlight" id="advertisers">
          <div class="icon">🚀</div>
          <h3>For Advertising Professionals</h3>
          <p>
            Interested in advertising? Apply to join our network and
            demonstrate your skills through an assessment.
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>Submit your application</li>
            <li>Complete a skills assessment</li>
            <li>Get reviewed for eligibility</li>
            <li>Become eligible for client assignments</li>
            <li>Develop practical experience</li>
          </ul>

          <a href="#contact" class="button">Apply to Join</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="how-it-works">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>How VIGayapan works</h2>
        <p>A straightforward process for businesses and applicants.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="steps">
        <article class="step">
          <div class="step-number">01</div>
          <h3>Tell Us Your Goal</h3>
          <p>
            Businesses share their advertising needs. Applicants share
            their background, interests and skills.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <div class="step-number">02</div>
          <h3>Review & Assessment</h3>
          <p>
            We review business requirements and assess applicants before
            considering them for client work.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <div class="step-number">03</div>
          <h3>Plan & Connect</h3>
          <p>
            Suitable advertising professionals may be matched with client
            projects based on requirements and availability.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="notice">
        <strong>Important:</strong> Passing an assessment does not guarantee
        employment or a client assignment. Assignments depend on client
        requirements, suitability and availability.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Why choose VIGayapan?</h2>
        <p>
          Our goal is to make advertising opportunities easier to explore
          for both businesses and aspiring professionals.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">🎯</div>
          <h3>Goal-Oriented Advertising</h3>
          <p>
            Focus on campaigns that fit your audience, business needs
            and promotional objectives.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">🤝</div>
          <h3>Skills-First Approach</h3>
          <p>
            Applicants are assessed before they can be considered
            for suitable advertising assignments.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">🌐</div>
          <h3>Online & Offline</h3>
          <p>
            Explore digital promotions alongside suitable local and
            traditional advertising opportunities.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">📈</div>
          <h3>Room to Grow</h3>
          <p>
            Build advertising campaigns, develop skills and create
            opportunities for long-term growth.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" id="contact">
      <h2>Ready to get started?</h2>
      <p>
        Tell us whether you want to advertise your business or apply
        to become an advertising professional.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:YOUR_EMAIL@example.com?subject=VIGayapan%20Enquiry"
         class="button">Contact VIGayapan</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <a href="#" class="logo">VIGayapan.</a>

    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#advertisers">Join Us</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>

    <p>Advertising opportunities. Creative connections.</p>
    <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> VIGayapan. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent =
      new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>

</body>
</html>
